<title>USA: O'Charley's Inc Q4 oper EPS flat.</title>
<headline>O'Charley's Inc Q4 oper EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 Wks Ended	 13 Wks Ended</p>
<p>				    Dec 29, 1996(1)  Dec 31,1995(3)(4)</p>
<p> Revenues			  $  39,671,000	$  37,932,000</p>
<p>Net earnings excluding</p>
<p>    litigation adjustment	  1,798,000	    1,805,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			  3,270,000	    1,805,000</p>
<p> EPS excluding litigation adjustment  0.21		   0.21</p>
<p> EPS					    0.39		   0.21</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs			 8,425,000	    8,454,000</p>
<p> Same store sales growth		  1.4%		   2.4%</p>
<p>					52 Wks Ended	 53 Wks Ended</p>
<p>					   Dec 29,		Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   1996(2)	     1995(3)(4)</p>
<p> Revenues			  $ 164,530,000	$ 147,557,000</p>
<p>Net earnings excluding</p>
<p>    one-time gain and charges    6,283,000	    6,002,000</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)	     (1,147,000)	   10,590,000</p>
<p> EPS excluding gain and charges	 0.75		   0.71</p>
<p> Net EPS				     (0.14)		   1.26</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs			 8,390,000	    8,438,000</p>
<p> Same store sales growth		  1.1%		   3.2%</p>
<p> Restaurant operating margin	   18.1%		  18.1%</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Q4 results include $2.3 million pre-tax gain or $0.18 per share on claims submitted in lawsuit settlement.</p>
<p>(2) 1996 earnings and EPS include pre-tax charges of $11.6 million, or $0.89 per share, for lawsuit settlement, adoption of FASB 121, acquisition costs of the Shoex transaction.</p>
<p>(3) 1995 results include one-time net gain of $7.4 million, or $0.55 per share, as a result of IPO of Logan's Roadhouse Inc in which O'Charley's sold substantially all of its stock in Logan's and related restaurant properties.</p>
<p>(4) 1995 results have been restated to reflect the combined operations of the Company and Shoex, which is accounted for as a pooling of interest.</p>
</text>
